<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Upon receipt of a Drawdown Notice, Conversion Notice or Rollover Notice,
as the case may be, the Administrative Agent will forthwith notify the Lenders of the proposed Drawdown Date, Conversion Date or Rollover
Date, as the case may be, of each Lender&rsquo;s Applicable Percentage of such Loan and, if applicable, the account of the Administrative
