<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">The Borrower hereby authorizes the Administrative Agent to debit any
account maintained by the Borrower with the Administrative Agent to satisfy its obligations to the Administrative Agent and the Lenders
in connection with the payment of interest, fees, expenses and other amounts due hereunder, in each case in accordance with the terms
