<TD STYLE="width: 1in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in; text-align: left">(b)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">if any Obligor breaches any covenant in Sections 9.03(1), 9.03(2),
9.03(3) or 9.03(4);</TD>
