<TD STYLE="width: 1in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in; text-align: left">(d)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">if any Obligor neglects to observe or perform, in any material
respect, any covenant or obligation contained in this Agreement or any other Loan Document on its part to be observed or performed (other
