<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Subject to any express verification
requirements set out in this Agreement, the Administrative Agent and each Lender may rely upon any agreement, document, notice, instruction
or instrument provided by any Obligor by electronic mail, facsimile or other similar electronic transmission as though it were an original
and may assume that such communication is genuine, reliable and authorized by the applicable Obligor.</P>

