<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">To the extent permitted
by Applicable Law and subject to the rights of the Administrative Agent as agent for the Lenders under this Agreement and the other
Loan Documents, after the occurrence and during the continuance of an Event of Default, the Administrative Agent and each Lender may
set off and apply any deposits or other sums at any time held by it for the account of any Obligor against any and all Obligations
